MAJOR_VERSION=4
STANDARD_VERSION=5
RELEASE_VERSION=1
DESCRIPTION=Stabilize browser-lab server relay CI by waiting for the hub listen port before WebSocket connect. Document portfolio iframe integration, ship Cloudflare Worker artifacts for first-visit lab boot on bailey-forbes.com, and add a portfolio live-lab patch for the guest window. Force-exit Playwright browser-boot/iframe tests after a hung browser.close() so CI does not sit after PASS. Switch session-1 coverage to the session tab sendText path so Playwright canvas typing cannot drop the digit key. Resolve the packaged-lab relay hub from the repo tools tree so FL_BROWSER_TEST_PACKAGED serve does not exit 1. Point the packaged Host/Join client at the test relay port instead of the baked-in 8767 manifest default. Wait for unique Session 2: root chrome before switching back to session 1 so a prior SWITCHUSER user=root line cannot release the test early. Keep packaged boot to one QEMU start plus identity/relay checks; pause/reset/power-off lifecycle stays on the independent run so CI does not flake on a post-reset VGA placeholder. Clear the freestanding command line before session new/switchuser so a leftover "session new" cannot make the iframe New session button print "no such session" instead of Session 2: root.

RELEASE_DATE=2026-09-15
